Write a short essay of about 150 words on the topic: "Modify the Words, Keep the Tenets".

Draw on Lesson 1 (the Hippocratic Oath as a medical ideal). Your essay should include:
- why the original wording collides with modern practice (give at least two examples: placebo, triage, insurance, high-dose chemotherapy, or euthanasia);
- the three main tenets that modern versions still share;
- your view of the oath as a code of practice and a dividing line between healers and killers.
